import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy policy" description="InkMagnet privacy policy.">
  <p>Last updated: June 10, 2026</p>

  <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    InkMagnet ("we") operates the website inkmagnet.com and the application app.inkmagnet.com.
    For any privacy matter, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@inkmagnet.com">contact@inkmagnet.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Account data: email address, name, password hash, or your Google account identifier if you sign in with Google.</li>
    <li>Content you create: book topics, instructions, generated and edited book content.</li>
    <li>Payment data: processed by Stripe; we never store card numbers.</li>
    <li>Technical data: IP address, browser information and basic usage logs, used for security and abuse prevention (including Google reCAPTCHA).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Why we process it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To provide the service: generating, storing and compiling your books (contract performance).</li>
    <li>To process payments and issue receipts (legal obligation, contract).</li>
    <li>To send transactional email such as verification codes and password resets (contract).</li>
    <li>To keep the service secure and prevent automated abuse (legitimate interest).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Processors we use</h2>
  <p>
    We use a small set of infrastructure providers to run the service: Amazon Web Services
    (hosting, storage, email delivery), Stripe (payments), Anthropic and other AI model providers
    (content generation; your book inputs are sent to them solely to generate your book), and
    Google (sign-in and reCAPTCHA).
  </p>

  <h2>5. Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Your account and books are kept until you delete them or your account. You can request
    deletion at any time by email; we remove personal data within 30 days, except where
    accounting law requires longer retention of billing records.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can request access to, correction, export or deletion of your personal data, object to
    processing based on legitimate interest, and lodge a complaint with your data protection
    authority. Write to <a href="mailto:contact@inkmagnet.com">contact@inkmagnet.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The marketing site uses no tracking cookies. The application uses strictly necessary
    storage for keeping you signed in. reCAPTCHA may set its own cookies as described in
    Google's privacy policy.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
